<% content_for :full_bleed, "1" %>
<% content_for :title, "Small Pharmacy DSCSA Exemption Extended to 2027 — Pharma Transport" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "The FDA extended the DSCSA small-dispenser exemption to #{DscsaDeadline.label}. Some requirements apply now. Free 2-minute readiness check, plus the platform and retainer that close the gaps." %>

<%
  assessment_link = dscsa_assessment_path
  call_link = request_a_call_path(topic: "dscsa_assessment")
%>

<section class="border-b border-line bg-gradient-to-b from-[#fbfcfd] to-[#f3f6f8]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-[76px]">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 max-w-[56ch]">
      <% if DscsaDeadline.passed? %>
        <span class="eyebrow">Small-dispenser exemption ended <%= DscsaDeadline.label %></span>
        <h1 class="text-[30px] sm:text-[44px] leading-[1.1]">The DSCSA exemption has ended. Is your pharmacy compliant?</h1>
        <p class="text-[17px] text-ink-soft">
          If you employ 25 or fewer full-time pharmacists and technicians, you were exempt
          from the enhanced drug distribution security requirements &mdash; package-level
          verification, electronic transaction data, a documented suspect-product process.
          That exemption ended on <%= DscsaDeadline.label %>, and the requirements apply now.
          Most small pharmacies are still catching up.
        </p>
      <% else %>
        <span class="eyebrow">Small-dispenser exemption extended to <%= DscsaDeadline.label %></span>
        <h1 class="text-[30px] sm:text-[44px] leading-[1.1]">The FDA gave small pharmacies one more year. Use it.</h1>
        <p class="text-[17px] text-ink-soft">
          On <%= DscsaDeadline.extended_label %> the FDA extended the DSCSA small-dispenser exemption to
          <%= DscsaDeadline.label %>. That delays the enhanced, package-level requirements &mdash; not
          DSCSA itself. Trading only with authorized partners, handling suspect product, and keeping
          six years of records apply today. Find out where you stand, then get ready without the scramble.
        </p>
      <% end %>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-1">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="<%= assessment_link %>">Take the free 2-minute readiness check</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#whats-changing">What&rsquo;s changing</a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[12.5px] text-ink-faint">No account needed. Answer 8 questions, get a score and a plain-English gap list.</p>
      <%= render "shared/deadline_offer" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# What's changing %>
<section id="whats-changing" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-[72px]">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 max-w-[50ch] mb-10">
    <span class="eyebrow">What&rsquo;s changing</span>
    <h2 class="text-[26px] sm:text-[28px]"><% if DscsaDeadline.passed? %>The exemption has ended.<% else %>Some of this applies now. The rest arrives <%= DscsaDeadline.label %>.<% end %></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
    <% [
      ["Required now: authorized partners", "Buy from and sell to licensed, authorized trading partners only, and accept product only with its identifier."],
      ["Required now: suspect product", "A documented process to quarantine and investigate suspect product, with FDA and trading-partner notification."],
      ["Required now: six-year records", "Transaction history retrievable on request, not reconstructed after the fact."],
      ["#{DscsaDeadline.passed? ? "Now" : DscsaDeadline::DATE.year}: package-level tracing", "Electronic, package-level transaction data from every wholesaler, and verification of individual packages."],
    ].each do |title, body| %>
      <div class="card p-6 flex flex-col gap-2">
        <h3 class="font-sans text-[14.5px] font-semibold"><%= title %></h3>
        <p class="text-[13.5px] text-ink-soft"><%= body %></p>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</section>

<%# How this closes the gap %>
<section class="bg-surface border-y border-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-[76px]">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 max-w-[52ch] mb-10">
      <span class="eyebrow">Two ways to close the gap</span>
      <h2 class="text-[26px] sm:text-[28px]">Software for what&rsquo;s software. A person for what isn&rsquo;t.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="card p-7 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <span class="badge badge-accent w-fit">The platform</span>
        <h3 class="font-sans text-[17px] font-semibold">Chain of custody, cold chain, records</h3>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-ink-soft">
          Live GPS fleet tracking, an immutable hash-chained custody log, proof-of-delivery
          signatures, continuous temperature monitoring, and an audit trail &mdash; generated as
          you ship, not reconstructed for an inspector. Every plan is the whole product,
          starting at $<%= @starter_monthly %>/month with a 14-day free trial.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary w-fit" href="<%= pricing_path %>">See pricing</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-7 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <span class="badge w-fit" style="color:#b45309;border-color:#ecd3ac;background-color:#fbf1e4;">The retainer</span>
        <h3 class="font-sans text-[17px] font-semibold">SOPs, verification process, trading-partner checks</h3>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-ink-soft">
          The gaps that are process and paperwork, not software &mdash; written procedures,
          product verification workflow, confirming your trading partners are authorized &mdash;
          go to a named fractional compliance officer who owns the answer instead of it landing
          on you.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary w-fit" href="<%= compliance_officer_path %>">See the retainer</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# Independents %>
<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-[72px]">
  <div class="card p-7 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] items-center">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
      <span class="eyebrow">Why local pharmacies come out ahead</span>
      <h2 class="text-[22px] sm:text-[24px]">Mail-order can&rsquo;t document a handoff it never makes.</h2>
      <p class="text-[14px] text-ink-soft">
        Signed custody and verified cold-chain records keep you audit-ready &mdash; and they&rsquo;re
        proof of the in-person care mail-order can&rsquo;t offer. Your records become your selling point.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:justify-self-end">
      <%= link_to "For independent pharmacies", independent_pharmacy_path, class: "btn btn-secondary" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<% if Time.current <= StripeBilling.founding_offer_cutoff %>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-14">
    <div class="rounded-sm border px-5 py-4 text-[14px] text-center" style="background-color:#fbf1e4;border-color:#ecd3ac;color:#5c4420;">
      <strong>Founding customer offer.</strong> Subscribe to any monthly plan before
      <%= StripeBilling.founding_offer_cutoff.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %> and get 25% off your first
      six months &mdash; applied automatically, no code needed.
    </div>
  </section>
<% end %>

<%# FAQ %>
<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-[76px]">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 mb-8">
    <span class="eyebrow">Questions</span>
    <h2 class="text-[26px]">Before you start the check</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-x-10">
    <% [
      ["How do I know if the exemption even applies to us?",
       "It applies if, as of #{DscsaDeadline.qualifying_label}, your pharmacy&rsquo;s owner employs 25 or fewer full-time licensed pharmacists and technicians across all locations. The readiness check asks this first &mdash; if it doesn&rsquo;t apply, the full requirements are already in force for you today, not pending."],
      ["Is this just a sales pitch disguised as a quiz?",
       "The check scores all 8 requirement areas and shows every gap in plain English whether or not you ever talk to us. Where the platform or the retainer closes a specific gap, it says so &mdash; and where neither does, it says that too."],
      ["We&rsquo;re not sure if we need software or a person.",
       "Most pharmacies need some of both. Custody, cold chain, and records are software problems; SOPs and verification process are usually not. The check&rsquo;s result page breaks down which is which for your specific answers."],
      ["The deadline moved. Why start now?",
       "Part of DSCSA applies today, and the FDA is still assessing small dispensers, so dates can move either way. Starting now means the #{DscsaDeadline::DATE.year} work is an upgrade to records you already keep, not a rebuild under time pressure."],
      ["How fast can we actually be ready?",
       "The platform side is live the day you start a trial &mdash; GPS, custody logging, and packet generation from your first shipment. The process side depends on what&rsquo;s missing; a 20-minute call is enough to scope it."],
    ].each do |q, a| %>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
        <h3 class="font-sans text-[15px] font-semibold"><%== q %></h3>
        <p class="text-[13.5px] text-ink-soft"><%== a %></p>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-brand-700 text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-[68px] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6">
    <h2 class="text-[24px] sm:text-[26px] text-white max-w-[28ch]">A year is plenty &mdash; if you start now.</h2>
    <div class="flex gap-3">
      <a class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:#1f3a53;" href="<%= assessment_link %>">Take the readiness check</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);color:#fff;background:transparent;" href="<%= call_link %>">Talk to someone first</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
